    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f3f49ff2bdb41efb4fefc3b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "关于“次世代潜力股”的话题，在训练员之间也时常被提起，\n而最近总会固定出现一个名字。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfea080128b4c46f88af3cc3202e35ede22d9a129847207a57e5bb995f8e661b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
