      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是啊。那孩子相当了不得。从小就被称为“神童”。\n据说就算在大型赛事里获胜，她也是一副理所当然的表情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c9c7aafbaf2f5287f5d7992288698559fd1df32186f2deb025f569be534e033",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
